<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
html { background: #ffffff; }
body {
  width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
  background: #F4F6F6;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.header {
  height: 65pt;
  background: #1C2833;
  padding: 18pt 40pt;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.header h1 {
  font-size: 26pt;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  margin: 0;
}
.content {
  padding: 20pt 40pt 50pt 40pt;
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  gap: 20pt;
}
.left {
  flex: 1;
}
.right {
  flex: 1;
}
.card {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-left: 5pt solid #D4AF37;
  border-radius: 6pt;
  padding: 10pt;
  margin-bottom: 10pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 4pt rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}
.card h2 {
  font-size: 13pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 5pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.card ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 18pt;
  font-size: 10pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.highlight {
  background: #D4AF37;
  color: #1C2833;
  padding: 8pt 10pt;
  border-radius: 6pt;
  margin-top: 8pt;
}
.highlight p {
  font-size: 10pt;
  margin: 0;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-align: center;
}
.chart-container {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 8pt;
  padding: 12pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 6pt rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  height: 100%;
}
.chart-container h3 {
  font-size: 13pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 8pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <h1>黄金：避险之王，再创新高</h1>
</div>
<div class="content">
  <div class="left">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>🔥 驱动因素</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>地缘政治不确定性加剧</li>
        <li>全球央行持续增持黄金储备</li>
        <li>美元走弱预期增强</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>📊 市场表现</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>紫金矿业净利润同比增65%</li>
        <li>金价突破2100美元/盎司</li>
        <li>黄金ETF持仓量回升</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="highlight">
      <p>💡 配置5-10%作为组合底仓，对冲市场波动</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="right">
    <div class="chart-container" id="gold-chart" class="placeholder" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"></div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
